.Dd $Mdocdate$
.Dt EGGHEAD-DOCTOR 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm egghead-doctor
.Nd diagnose setup problems
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm egghead doctor
.Op Fl -config Ar path
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Cm doctor
runs every check
.Nm egghead
needs to come up cleanly and reports pass, fail, or warning for
each. Use it after install, after editing the configuration, when
something is misbehaving, and any time the answer is non-obvious.
.Pp
.Cm doctor
warns; it does not block. Even when warnings fire, records still
load and the system still starts; the warnings exist to surface
problems that would otherwise corrupt frontmatter silently or leave
agents running with less authority than their records imply.
.Sh CHECKS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Sy Configuration file
Exists at the expected path and parses as YAML. The error message
points at
.Cm egghead init
when no file exists.
.It Sy Records directory
Exists and is readable.
.It Sy SQLite index
Present at
.Pa <records_dir>/.egghead/index.db .
A missing index is a soft warning; it is rebuilt automatically on
next start.
.It Sy NIF binary
The OpenTUI native bridge is present for the current platform.
.It Sy Web endpoint
Reachable when a node is already running, or the port is available
when standalone.
.It Sy Log file
.Pa $XDG_STATE_HOME/egghead/egghead.log
is writable.
.It Sy Sandbox backend
.Xr sandbox-exec 1
on macOS,
.Xr bwrap 1
on Linux. Without it, agents holding
.Sy fs.*
or
.Sy proc.*
grants run unsandboxed and the runtime warns at startup.
.It Sy BEAM cookie
.Pa ~/.erlang.cookie
exists and has restrictive permissions, when cross-host attach is
configured.
.It Sy inotify-tools Pq Linux only
.Xr inotifywait 1
is on
.Ev PATH .
Without it the file watcher cannot pick up records edited outside
.Nm
in real time.
.It Sy LLM providers
Each configured provider answers a small request.
.It Sy Agent capability hygiene
For each
.Cm class: agent
record:
malformed frontmatter, unknown capability names (with suggested
close matches), unknown scope keys, scope values whose types do not
match the key, escalation risks (an
.Sy fs.write
that covers the records directory, a
.Sy proc.exec
with no
.Sy in: , Sy cmds: ,
or
.Sy patterns: ),
and external grants that have no hoistable sandbox root and would
therefore be inert.
.El
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "--config path"
.It Fl -config Ar path
Override the configuration file location.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show help.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
egghead doctor
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr egghead-config 1 ,
.Xr egghead-llm 1 ,
.Xr egghead-service 1 ,
.Xr egghead 1 ,
.Xr egghead 5
